function clear {a pointer to a cad face loop adjacency values:values}:
    execute:
        set values's length to 0

flex function remove the last item from {a pointer to a cad face loop adjacency values:values}:
    replacement:
        if (the length of values) = 0:
            stop because a list index is out of bounds
        set values's length to (values's length) - 1

function the cad clone of {cad face loop adjacency:original}:
